OL,3,GNEWSASpeeding driver ran red light
OL,4,Abefore fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA speeding driver who killed a young
OL,7,Fwoman when he ran a red light while
OL,8,Fusing his mobile phone has been jailed
OL,9,Ffor five years.
OL,11,FMohammad Akhtar, 28, was driving a BMW
OL,12,F320d when he hit 21-year-old Ayesha
OL,13,FHussein in Hamm Strasse, in Bradford,
OL,14,Fon 4 November 2023.
OL,16,FWest Yorkshire police said Akhtar's
OL,17,Fwife and child were also in the car at
OL,18,Fthe time of the crash.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
