OL,3,GNEWSASpeeding driver ran red light
OL,4,Abefore fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAkhtar, of Holme Street, Bradford, was
OL,7,Fjailed at Bradford Crown Court on
OL,8,FFriday, having admitted to causing her
OL,9,Fdeath by dangerous driving. He was also
OL,10,Fbanned from driving for
OL,11,Fseven-and-a-half years.
